Package: ptscotch-gnu15-mpich-ohpc
Architecture: any
Depends: ohpc-filesystem, gnu15-compilers-ohpc (>= 14.1.0), mpich-gnu15-ohpc, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Graph, mesh and hypergraph partitioning library - MPI variant (gnu15 + mpich, OpenHPC)
 Scotch is a software package for graph and mesh/hypergraph partitioning and
 sparse matrix ordering. PT-Scotch is the parallel (MPI) variant.
 Built with the gnu15 compiler family and mpich MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
